Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.48,0:00:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,120,000 kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Konoe says that if we don't pay,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.73,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,they won't accept Imagawa\NYoshimoto's succession.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.45,0:00:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,An impossible task.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you blushing?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.86,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.86,0:00:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Katsuie and the others are fighting.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.74,0:00:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for the high general \Nto be goofing off here?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.60,0:00:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And you have to get 120,000 kan, too, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.23,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here in Sakai.
