Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The free trade city of Sakai.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.72,0:02:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A rare and valued neutral \Nground in the Sengoku Era,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.43,0:02:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and a "golden city" which\Namassed great wealth
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.62,0:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,through trade with Asia\Nand the European nations.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.41,0:02:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This city is ruled by Egoushuu,\Na group of thirty-six merchants.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.46,0:02:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the one who leads that group...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.61,0:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is this man, Imai Soukyuu.
