Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.77,0:02:48.81,Names,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\alpha60\blur3\pos(1677.405,942.51)}Imai\NSoukyuu
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.23,Names,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\blur0.75\pos(1674.405,939.525)}Imai\NSoukyuu
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.23,Names,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\alpha60\blur3\pos(1677.405,942.525)}Imai\NSoukyuu
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.10,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see that the princess \Nof Oda is such a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite honest for a merchant.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.49,0:02:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flattery. Just flatter—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.44,0:03:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.09,0:03:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like your father.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.77,0:03:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure get along with Imai Soukyuu, here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.27,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a regular character in the Ambition of Lord Nobunaga.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever the seasons change, \Nhe comes to sell you teacups.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.43,0:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monkey says interesting things.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.82,0:03:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he's from the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.93,0:03:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,From the future?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about the 120,000 kan, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.51,0:03:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.61,0:03:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Perhaps it was a little cruel to ask that of the impoverished Oda count.{I think I misused countess in previous episodes. As far as I understand it now, a countess is the a count's spouse, rather than a female equivalant. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.62,0:03:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't say she wouldn't pay.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.79,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She just wants a little more time.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If the amount is not paid by the deadline,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.22,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not accept Imagawa!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.00,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to make her do?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.32,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that she's talented \Nmeans she can be of use.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.27,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If Imagawa's succession is declared, it\Nbrings us one step closer to uniting Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.90,0:04:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.61,0:04:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Members of the Oda clan have always\Nbeen splendid customers, but I can't.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.96,0:04:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You make plenty of money \Noff your takoyaki, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.30,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to give you 120,000 kan, I'd be bankrupt!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask the other merchants...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.83,0:04:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, we could have the Egoushuu\Nthirty-six pay 3,334 kan each.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.59,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Let's do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.48,0:04:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.84,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a monopoly on takoyaki \Nstands, so they don't like me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.95,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Tsuda Soukyuu of Tennoujiya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Soukyuu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is the only thing \Nwe have in common.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.80,0:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do anything for money.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.66,0:04:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And that makes him a fierce opponent.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.28,0:05:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.08,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awful fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Five points.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.71,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.86,0:05:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyoshi Masayasu, prepare to die!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.66,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.92,0:05:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single Oda troop... will leave here alive!{CR line was shit. TLC plz}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you try it! {CR line didn't make sense given the previous line. TLC plz}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...can fight!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.26,0:06:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Using elephants isn't fair.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to call back Motoyasu to reinforce us?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.06,0:06:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave Mikawa open long\Nenough to give Takeda a chance at it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where's Hanbei?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.70,0:06:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She went to help.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.43,0:06:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then things will work out somehow.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.64,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Hanbei I'll leave the rest to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.94,0:06:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.93,0:06:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That just leaves the money problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.31,0:06:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.41,0:06:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to report.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How did things go with Konoe?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.73,0:06:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.61,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.56,0:06:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew it was coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.67,0:06:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.27,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back to protecting Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.09,0:06:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.06,0:06:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make up for my failure.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.89,0:06:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry\Nabout it so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But okay. Have any good \Nideas to get the money?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all you want, it's easy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.23,0:07:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn down Sakai, chase off the \Nmerchants, and the money is all—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.87,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakai is our gateway to the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.03,0:07:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where East and West meet,\Nand everyone is filled with life.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.78,0:07:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday I'm going to \Nmake all of Japan like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All of Japan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakai has true freedom, something this country's never had.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something I should protect.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying it is out of the question.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.72,0:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how I focused on \Nmy studies and martial arts,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the only one who recognized \Nmy talent was my mother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.73,0:07:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Juubei.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.85,0:07:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud that you're \Ncarrying on the Akechi line.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.74,0:07:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.99,0:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be a splendid general.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.00,0:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,671)}Someday, they'll understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.87,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(189,0)}And then I met Lord Nobuna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.43,0:08:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Overwhelming talent and beauty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eyes that saw into the next era.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.43,0:08:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At last, I thought, I'd \Nfound someone like me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only ones who understand\Nme, Akechi Juubei Mitsuhide,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.98,0:08:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}are my mother and Lord Nobuna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't fail again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.35,0:08:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Watch me, Mother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.28,0:08:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll unite Japan with Lord Nobuna!{\i0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.36,Ep Title,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fs82.5\blur0.9\fnEdo SZ\c&H212022&\pos(1059.429,202.071)\frz1.089\frx334\fry2}Naya
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.36,Ep Title,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fs82.5\blur0.9\fnEdo SZ\c&H78757C&\frz1.089\pos(1059.429,203.571)\frx334\fry2}Naya
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.36,Ep Title,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fs82.5\blur0.9\fnEdo SZ\c&H212022&\frz1.089\pos(1059.429,208.071)\frx334\fry2}Naya
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.93,0:08:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand why you've come to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.87,0:08:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be the one to unite Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.76,0:08:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can think of this \Nas an early investment.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.51,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyoshi and Matsunaga remain in Setsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.32,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Asakura, Kai, and Takeda are in \NEchizen, and Uesugi is in Echigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.02,0:08:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have many enemies left, I believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And doesn't the fact that Advisor Konoe
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.44,0:09:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,gave you this task suggest \Nhe refuses to accept you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.77,0:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad. He's right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.23,0:09:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuda{-han}, Lord Oda Nobuna \Nisn't like the other counts.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.26,0:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}More than anything, she cares about the city of Sakai.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're that impressed by her,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.64,0:09:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,then why not sell your \Nmonopoly on takoyaki stands?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.91,0:09:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.99,0:09:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy it for 120,000 kan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.81,0:09:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. We'll sell you something.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.40,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be satisfied with a dish suited to \Nthe palate of a Kansai native, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.48,0:09:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have something like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.63,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The monkey will make it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.75,0:09:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.69,0:09:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}No way! Mr. Monkey can't possibly do that! Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.14,0:09:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure Monkey can do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.23,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.00,0:09:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll have young Akechi\Nmake something as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.87,0:10:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A competition would be more exciting.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.03,0:10:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will bet on Akechi{-dono}, and \NImai{-dono} will bet on the monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.62,0:10:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What, exactly, will we be betting?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.15,0:10:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A position within the Egoushuu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.44,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.63,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win, I'll buy Akechi{-dono}'s \Ndish for 120,000 kan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a bad deal.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Soukyuu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.65,0:10:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When I unite Japan, I'll make you
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.80,0:10:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest merchant in Japan—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.86,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll make you best in {\i1}the world!{\i0}\NYou have my word!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Best in the world?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.66,0:10:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see that coming, but no matter \Nwho wins, we get the 120,000 kan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we both do well.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.67,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through with acting like you're senior to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.25,0:10:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to a monkey man.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If {\i1}I{\i0} don't win, there's no point!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, Imai...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.62,0:11:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna will be saved by {\i1}my{\i0} 120,000.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.48,0:11:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to anyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.55,0:11:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Akechi clan is ancient and respected.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.16,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to listen to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.44,0:11:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After my father died, my \Nmother led the clan herself
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.68,0:11:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and raised me as best she could \Nto make me a great general.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.82,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother has fallen ill, \Nand the only thing I can do
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.80,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,to repay her is become \NNo. 1 in the Oda clan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.53,0:11:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you want to do something \Nnice for your mother, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than that!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.25,0:11:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.06,0:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyone who gets \Nin my way is an enemy!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.73,0:11:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Juubei{\i0} said that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.05,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you win, it's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But now Imai's involved, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Her taking it seriously is a good thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.69,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, have you \Nthought of anything good?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take something \Nspecial to satisfy them.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.62,0:12:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I had some ideas, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Takoyaki, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.44,0:12:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And Tsuda Soukyuu probably intends to \Nhave Akechi{-dono} make takoyaki, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if Juubei wins...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.96,0:12:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His goal the whole time has\Nbeen to join the Egoushuu,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.30,0:12:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and get the monopoly on takoyaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.52,0:12:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,120,000 kan is a small price to pay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.30,0:12:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,His plan was to help the Oda clan while \Nmaking sure he got the biggest benefit.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.69,0:12:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean he used us?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.33,0:12:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't underestimate Tsuda Soukyuu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew that, then why agree?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.48,0:12:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of a merchant's\Njob to be a judge of people.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.48,0:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And in my opinion,\NOda Nobuna will unite Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess trusts \Nyou more than anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have to believe in you, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.24,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Imai...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.12,0:12:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Tsuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.37,0:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If Oda gets the 120,000 kan, then I will\Nhave to accept Imagawa's succession!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.88,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He chose the one who'd \Nmake him more money.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what merchants do.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.65,0:13:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even to my detriment?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.11,0:13:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.\NWe're allies, not your servants.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.40,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. As long as I can eliminate \Nthe barbarians, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.53,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy you came to\Nsee me, Mr. Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.81,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine any kind of new takoyaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.33,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So I figured, in this era, \NEuropean spices might be rare.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"In this era"?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak as if you \Ncame from the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,400 years or so.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,400 years, is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.77,0:13:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not very surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.59,0:13:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I sensed that something about you \Nwas different from other people.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.84,0:13:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's a better time than now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.87,0:14:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that it's peaceful \Nand there's no war.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.53,0:14:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a blessing from God.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.78,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I think that future was forged by human hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Human hands?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.55,0:14:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to the people \Nwho tried to open a new era.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.33,0:14:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,People like Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.83,0:14:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to meet her even more.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for something?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.67,0:14:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, mayonnaise for my salad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayonnaise?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.71,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But next is...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.51,0:14:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Animals fear fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't miss this chance. Attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only target is the Miyoshi forces!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.47,0:14:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.91,0:15:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.08,0:15:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Oda!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.81,0:15:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Miyoshi Three fled to Shikoku.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.92,0:15:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Matsunaga Danjo vanished, and the area\Naround Kyo was pacified by the Oda forces.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.36,0:15:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come one, come all! It's time \Nfor the takoyaki battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.62,0:15:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}In the Red stall, Akechi Juubei Mitsuhide and her assistant Inuchiyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.37,0:15:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Blue stall, Monkey and Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.62,0:15:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner gets 120,000 kan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.36,0:15:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose and you get sent to \Nthe dungeon in Gifu Castle!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.86,0:15:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me that!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.26,0:15:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop whining and get started!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.79,0:15:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey Man, you're going\Nto the dungeons!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.64,0:16:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Juubei already has her batter,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and is totally prepared!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.67,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just plain old batter!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.77,0:16:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The wheat is fragrant \Nand firm Sanugi wheat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.64,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've added a delicious stock \Nmade of konbu seaweed and bonito!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.03,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-She knows just what \Npeople from Kansai want!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at the mountain \Nof high class ingredients!
