Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.66,0:16:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.44,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Takoyaki is commoner food.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.62,0:16:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just upset 'cause you're losing.{He got his sticky white stuff on her face. >.>}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.63,0:16:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.67,0:16:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Add in the top quality Akashi octopus!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.11,0:16:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oda Nobuna will be the \None to unite Japan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Akechi Juubei Mitsuhide will \Nbe the one who gets her there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.38,0:16:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid! Just splendid!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.39,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to that...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.18,0:16:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The fire's not strong enough?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.63,0:16:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.07,0:16:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My fire was a little too strong.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. Look at those flames.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.60,0:16:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.67,0:17:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For my mother who believed in me,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.46,0:17:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose to Monkey Man!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.45,0:17:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.83,0:17:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.44,0:17:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.26,0:17:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not enough oil.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.79,0:17:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oil? That's it, oil!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.17,0:17:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried takoyaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.88,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the Monkey language!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.78,0:17:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what that is,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but when he starts talking in\NMonkey language, he's serious!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.40,0:17:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What will he show us?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried takoyaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.94,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bluff, what else?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} this?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dark and hard...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.04,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's got this white \Ngooey stuff splashed on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.00,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making it sound so dirty!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.92,0:17:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a condiment called mayonnaise.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayonnaise?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.59,0:18:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I eating?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.45,0:18:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I'm crying.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.22,0:18:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This "mayonnaise," in combination with \Nthe crispy texture, is exquisite!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.39,0:18:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.22,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This can't be.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.00,0:18:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lord Nobuna's smile belongs to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.01,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.00,0:18:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Miso-takoyaki topped with plenty of \NLord Nobuna's favorite, Hacchou miso!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.85,0:18:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now eat up and cry tears of joy.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.16,0:18:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.61,0:19:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I eating?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.85,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the ingredients are perfect, \Nbut she rushed and ruined it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.75,0:19:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's in the bag!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.07,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now announce the votes \Nof the thirty-six Sakai Egoushuu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Akechi Mitsuhide!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.72,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu should have won.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Say whatever you like.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.05,0:19:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won, that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You used a lot of money.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.51,0:19:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just leave the miso off when \Nwe serve it to the customers.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.63,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the takoyaki and Sakai are mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.67,0:19:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the rules.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.69,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fried takoyaki are mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.51,0:19:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.87,0:19:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need them, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.17,0:20:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.20,0:20:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the princess unites \NJapan, Sakai will be mine again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.43,0:20:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not counting your \Nchickens before they've hatched.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.17,0:20:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.90,0:20:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfectly okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.51,0:20:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can head off to the \NGifu dungeons, Monkey Man.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.51,0:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Lord Nobuna, time to order him away!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.03,0:20:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lord Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.71,0:20:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the 120,000 kan to \NKonoe in the morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.51,0:20:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, Mitsuhide?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.93,0:20:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mitsuhide?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're terrible.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.35,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.54,0:21:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuda has planted the seeds.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.16,0:21:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Distrust.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.14,0:21:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Obsession.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.14,0:21:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ambition.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.33,0:21:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The seeds will grow by \Nfeeding upon these feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.31,0:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait till they bloom.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.42,0:21:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that the money's been found,\NI must accept Imagawa's succession.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.05,0:21:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if she's still around to succeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.49,0:21:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean... have Yoshimoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.33,0:22:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugitani Zenjuubou.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.71,0:22:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.57,0:22:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
